# Example project-level npmrc for publishing fnrpc TS packages.
# Copy to `.npmrc` (already gitignored) and fill in a token.
#
# The token must be an npm token with publish rights and 2FA-TO-PUBLISH
# DISABLED (granular token -> turn OFF "Require 2FA to publish"), so that
# `bun publish` can authenticate without prompting for an OTP.
//
registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=npm_REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
